00:29:42,266 --> 00:29:44,066
such as the new mechanical armor

508
00:29:44,300 --> 00:29:46,366
this is a modular armor

509
00:29:46,366 --> 00:29:50,200
where you can install in each armor an energy core

510
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:52,500
no, a frame? OK

511
00:29:52,900 --> 00:29:54,400
then we add an energy core

512
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:59,100
and finally we can add various modules to obtain different effects

513
00:30:00,066 --> 00:30:05,266
but at the moment it's a little bit disappointing

514
00:30:06,466 --> 00:30:10,500
because we can't really make any of the good modules

515
00:30:11,666 --> 00:30:15,600
the jetpack, we don't have titanium yet

516
00:30:16,866 --> 00:30:22,866
and all of the good stuff of course requires a better core than the Nano one which is the only one I can make

517
00:30:22,866 --> 00:30:27,566
so, I guess we're going to try out this armor in the future, not now

518
00:30:28,266 --> 00:30:33,133
the other thing we can do to obtain more drops from the mobs is a cleaver

519
00:30:33,133 --> 00:30:36,333
that has a base chance of getting heads at least 20%

520
00:30:36,700 --> 00:30:41,466
but we can add first a diamond and a block of gold to increase the modifier by 1

521
00:30:41,966 --> 00:30:46,933
then one diamond block and then enchanting golden apple

522
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:48,600
to get a second modifier

523
00:30:49,133 --> 00:30:57,900
and the two modifiers we did that for are ender pearl and obsidian to get two more levels of beheading

524
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:01,400
reaching a 40% chance of dropping mob heads

525
00:31:02,333 --> 00:31:03,766
and as a ranged weapon

526
00:31:03,766 --> 00:31:07,733
we are also getting a crossbow made out of carbon

527
00:31:07,733 --> 00:31:10,900
with the vanadiumsteel tipped carbon bolts

528
00:31:14,266 --> 00:31:18,200
and of course we shall add more modifiers

529
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:22,166
which are going to use to give some durability to this crossbow

530
00:31:22,166 --> 00:31:24,200
and a little bit of extra speed

531
00:31:25,166 --> 00:31:27,900
and all of the quartz we can (add) to the bolts

532
00:31:29,500 --> 00:31:32,133
that should deal a good amount of damage

533
00:31:32,133 --> 00:31:34,166
it's still slow though

534
00:31:34,166 --> 00:31:36,066
well, 47 attack damage

535
00:31:37,500 --> 00:31:40,666
and with this we are ready to go look for the end portal

536
00:31:41,633 --> 00:31:43,933
which was rather close to our base

537
00:31:44,766 --> 00:31:48,300
and with that, we have the ender pearl required to craft the EnderIO machines

538
00:31:49,166 --> 00:31:50,333
to power those

539
00:31:50,733 --> 00:31:54,200
the trick is that you have to first place the machine

540
00:31:54,566 --> 00:31:56,866
and then you connect the cable

541
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:58,533
there we go

542
00:31:59,566 --> 00:32:04,366
anyways, the reason we are doing all of that is just so we can craft a powered spawner

543
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:07,900
which I'm going to use to quickly farm some wither skulls

544
00:32:08,600 --> 00:32:11,166
because I'm too lazy to make a proper mob farm

545
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:14,800
they says smart people are lazy, I think

546
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:19,133
but I'm not too sure if every lazy person is also smart

547
00:32:19,133 --> 00:32:21,466
and correlation does not mean causation

548
00:32:22,200 --> 00:32:27,466
anyways, the reason we are farming nether stars is so that we can build a NASA workbench

549
00:32:27,533 --> 00:32:31,500
and this is required to craft our next main objective, a rocket

550
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:34,100
and while you could totally argue that this is rocket science

551
00:32:34,366 --> 00:32:35,566
it's not that hard

552
00:32:36,533 --> 00:32:38,366
so here's a few tips for you

553
00:32:38,733 --> 00:32:41,366
first tip was at the beginning of this episode

554
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:42,900
keep buying industrial TNTs

555
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:46,300
because you're going to need a lot of explosives there

556
00:32:46,733 --> 00:32:51,400
so if you if you keep buying TNT from the beginning of HV

557
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:54,000
you should have enough to complete the rocket

558
00:32:54,733 --> 00:32:56,600
also be careful with the industrial TNT

559
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,066
because as far as I remember

560
00:32:58,100 --> 00:32:59,666
if you place this one

561
00:32:59,766 --> 00:33:00,966
if you place one

562
00:33:01,933 --> 00:33:04,733
every attempt of removing it will blow it up

563
00:33:05,366 --> 00:33:11,300
then having a dedicated bending machine for an implosion compressor could be a good idea

564
00:33:11,933 --> 00:33:16,200
and always try to batch craft when you have to craft so many items

565
00:33:17,133 --> 00:33:26,033
like few episodes ago, I said that with NEI it's way easier to use the auto crafting

566
00:33:26,033 --> 00:33:27,400
so you don't waste resources

567
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:29,700
but when you have to deal with machines

568
00:33:30,166 --> 00:33:33,000
you kind of have to batch craft

569
00:33:33,166 --> 00:33:36,066
like don't craft every time a single circuit

570
00:33:36,266 --> 00:33:40,200
craft one stack of circuits, two times in the whole playthrough

571
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:43,566
then in space, you are going to need some oxygen

572
00:33:43,900 --> 00:33:47,700
and those oxygen tanks are rather disappointing

573
00:33:47,700 --> 00:33:50,666
so if you are not using teleportation commands

574
00:33:50,700 --> 00:33:52,300
I heavily suggest

575
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:55,300
making sure you can charge up those in space

576
00:33:56,100 --> 00:33:57,966
as always, read the quest book

577
00:33:57,966 --> 00:34:00,266
because it explains everything pretty well

578
00:34:00,500 --> 00:34:05,166
but in my opinion, it's just so easy to have some liquid oxygen put it in a canister

579
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:07,000
place your compressor

580
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:09,200
give it one of your old batteries

581
00:34:09,700 --> 00:34:11,133
put the canister inside

582
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:15,366
and then you just fill your oxygen tanks like that

583
00:34:15,900 --> 00:34:17,466
and after a lot of crafting

584
00:34:17,466 --> 00:34:19,800
we finally obtain our rocket

585
00:34:20,733 --> 00:34:23,266
to launch it, we are going to have to fuel it up

586
00:34:23,266 --> 00:34:24,933
so we use a fuel loader

587
00:34:25,066 --> 00:34:27,666
which once again we can power just with batteries

588
00:34:27,966 --> 00:34:29,966
and we are going to need some fuel

589
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,566
the fuel for this rocket is cetane-boosted diesel

590
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:36,700
the fuel I was too lazy to make a five machine crafting chain for

591
00:34:36,733 --> 00:34:43,000
and since I'm so lazy, instead of even manually crafting it

592
00:34:43,333 --> 00:34:45,866
what I'm going to do is

593
00:34:47,066 --> 00:34:49,466
craft an MV World Accelerators

594
00:34:50,066 --> 00:34:57,200
because this one, we complete a quest that as a reward will give us enough fuel to go whatever we want with our rocket

595
00:34:57,800 --> 00:35:03,100
so once again, we place the rocket on the loading site thing (?)

596
00:35:03,100 --> 00:35:05,566
and then we move the fuel in

597
00:35:05,700 --> 00:35:11,466
using a large cell will be way better than using those small cells, but whatever

598
00:35:12,266 --> 00:35:14,200
by the way, if you don't disable pollution

599
00:35:14,200 --> 00:35:19,133
you should launch your rocket from a little bit far from your base

600
00:35:19,133 --> 00:35:23,800
because it's going to produce a lot of pollution when you launch it

601
00:35:24,666 --> 00:35:30,400
and another super important thing before launching is always do a backup

602
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:35,066
you do not want to mess this up

603
00:35:35,200 --> 00:35:36,733
many things can go wrong

604
00:35:36,966 --> 00:35:38,700
most likely you will forget something

605
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:42,700
so make sure you do a backup before launching the rocket

606
00:35:43,733 --> 00:35:45,300
and once everything is ready

607
00:35:45,333 --> 00:35:47,266
we can launch to the moon

608
00:35:49,333 --> 00:35:51,533
it will take a little bit to reach the orbit

609
00:35:51,933 --> 00:35:53,600
the tier 1 rocket

610
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:55,166
this one is also rather slow

611
00:35:55,466 --> 00:35:59,000
higher tier rockets would be a little bit faster at reaching the moon

612
00:35:59,133 --> 00:36:01,600
you can also tilt it and go sideways

613
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:06,500
it's a (luxury?) way of traveling through the world, but

614
00:36:06,866 --> 00:36:09,566
maybe there are better ways

615
00:36:09,566 --> 00:36:13,766
I mean you can tilt it like that and go wherever you want

616
00:36:13,766 --> 00:36:16,500
but ideally you should simply go up

617
00:36:18,900 --> 00:36:20,566
and after enough time

618
00:36:20,666 --> 00:36:23,000
you should reach this screen there

619
00:36:23,333 --> 00:36:26,466
at this point, you have to be a little bit careful, but not too much

620
00:36:26,500 --> 00:36:28,366
you click once on the overworld

621
00:36:28,900 --> 00:36:30,533
second time it will zoom in

622
00:36:30,900 --> 00:36:33,600
then you select the moon and you do launch

623
00:36:33,966 --> 00:36:35,933
and if everything is fine

624
00:36:35,933 --> 00:36:39,433
you should be there without taking damage

625
00:36:39,433 --> 00:36:41,966
now, you should hold space to slow down

626
00:36:41,966 --> 00:36:43,466
but if you look below the map

627
00:36:43,466 --> 00:36:44,500
you can see the (epsilon?)

628
00:36:44,500 --> 00:36:47,966
my suggestion is start slowing down at 300

629
00:36:51,900 --> 00:36:54,133
yes, maybe a little bit

630
00:36:54,733 --> 00:36:57,733
maybe it's like four or 5 hundreds, but OK

631
00:36:57,733 --> 00:36:59,100
you can just slow down

632
00:36:59,666 --> 00:37:03,733
I don't like all of the time it takes to land, but OK

633
00:37:04,166 --> 00:37:07,166
so OK, we are on the moon now

634
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:12,700
what we are looking for here is titanium and neodymium mostly

635
00:37:14,333 --> 00:37:16,633
galena, oh bauxite

636
00:37:16,633 --> 00:37:18,700
OK that is what we are looking for

637
00:37:19,300 --> 00:37:21,733
and of course, at this point of the game

638
00:37:22,200 --> 00:37:26,700
we are going to use an automated miner with a compressed chest

639
00:37:26,700 --> 00:37:31,100
which we can pick up later with all of the contents inside it

640
00:37:32,133 --> 00:37:36,966
and what we want to recover out of all of those ores is as much rutile as we can

641
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:41,700
with that and some carbon we can produce titaniumtetrachloride

642
00:37:42,566 --> 00:37:47,000
I didn't mention the chlorine because that is going to be looping inside the system

643
00:37:47,533 --> 00:37:50,000
and this is yet again one more automation

644
00:37:50,600 --> 00:37:58,000
now a few things I probably want to show that I haven't shown yet in automation systems is that

645
00:37:58,000 --> 00:38:01,333
you can for example lock output buses

646
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:05,166
you can for example split the solids two

647
00:38:05,166 --> 00:38:08,000
I mean I showed that with liquid but so it's different

648
00:38:09,100 --> 00:38:11,333
and also a few tricks with conduits

649
00:38:11,533 --> 00:38:13,200
conduits are super versatile

650
00:38:13,600 --> 00:38:15,733
if you already know how those works it's really nice

651
00:38:16,533 --> 00:38:19,133
otherwise specifically in a closed loop like that

652
00:38:19,133 --> 00:38:21,700
where I know I have a fixed amount of items

653
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:25,933
I can save a filter by having a higher priority filter

654
00:38:26,266 --> 00:38:32,166
and the leftover which is only a different item and with limited amount goes into the lower priority thing there

655
00:38:33,666 --> 00:38:36,933
also you can drag filtering items from NEI

656
00:38:36,933 --> 00:38:39,533
but I think that's probably nothing special

657
00:38:39,700 --> 00:38:41,600
just wanted to show that too

658
00:38:42,500 --> 00:38:45,066
and with that, we finally obtain titanium

659
00:38:45,066 --> 00:38:49,466
and reach the point of the game where I call tutorial complete

660
00:38:50,500 --> 00:38:52,766
and I say we just finished the tutorial

661
00:38:52,766 --> 00:38:57,900
because this is the point where the game gets a little bit faster and more

662
00:38:58,466 --> 00:39:01,333
this is the point where GTNH becomes GTNH

663
00:39:01,566 --> 00:39:05,400
and nowadays every GregTech modpack is more or less similar

664
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:08,400
but used to be a bigger deal in my opinion

665
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:13,066
so, see you next time for AE2 and EV

666
00:39:14,133 --> 00:39:15,900
they almost forgot to say bye bye

667
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:01,566
欢迎回来

668
00:00:01,566 --> 00:00:04,466
今天我们将看到 HV 时代

669
00:00:05,033 --> 00:00:08,166
这是另一个充满妙妙工具的时代，不像 MV

670
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,666
（向上合并）

671
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:13,000
我们首先注意到的

672
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,966
一旦我们达到 HV，自动售货机解锁许多新的交易

673
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:27,066
我的建议是开始并持续购买尽可能多的工业 TNT

674
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,066
这个，工业 TNT

675
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,333
之后你会需要一堆这个的

676
00:00:34,966 --> 00:00:37,866
你应该需要建一条它的被动产线

677
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,733
但是你只要持续购买就可以获得你需要的数量

678
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:48,566
然后，还有其他一些东西你可能想要

679
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,500
但在我看来，这是你目前最该买的东西

680
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:58,800
另一件事是我积攒了一堆战利品袋

681
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:03,566
那些战利品袋没那么有趣，但是

682
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,300
你可以把这些合成为下一阶段的战利品袋

683
00:01:06,466 --> 00:01:09,933
HV 战利品袋实际上很有趣

684
00:01:10,866 --> 00:01:14,966
我是说，这也不是最棒的东西

685
00:01:15,066 --> 00:01:20,933
但是你可以开出一些制作起来很烦人的东西

686
00:01:21,766 --> 00:01:24,200
所以我把所有的战利品袋都换成了 HV 战利品袋

687
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,266
然后打开

688
00:01:25,266 --> 00:01:26,700
这就是我们的收获

689
00:01:27,566 --> 00:01:34,200
这可能比在你可以选择不同任务奖励的时候挑选当时感觉最需要的锭更糟糕

690
00:01:35,266 --> 00:01:36,766
不管怎样，回到 HV 机器

691
00:01:36,766 --> 00:01:39,300
第一个亮点是通用研磨机

692
00:01:39,466 --> 00:01:41,133
这个像普通的研磨机一样工作

693
00:01:41,133 --> 00:01:43,166
但它也可以产出副产品

694
00:01:43,566 --> 00:01:47,233
例如，这对于获得额外的镓非常有用

695
00:01:47,233 --> 00:01:49,300
或者大量的铬，通过研磨机处理红宝石两次，然后制作红宝石汁

696
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:55,200
（向上合并）

697
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:59,333
另一个很酷的玩具是高级卷板机

698
00:01:59,333 --> 00:02:01,300
可以让你制作锡罐

699
00:02:01,866 --> 00:02:05,366
这是一种完全不同的食物管理方式

700
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,300
因为你不再需要轮换食物

701
00:02:07,466 --> 00:02:11,000
你可以非常容易地用任何食物填饱肚子

702
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:13,666
但最好的是新的高级矿机

703
00:02:14,366 --> 00:02:17,866
虽然我们本可以更早做出矿机

704
00:02:17,966 --> 00:02:23,533
HV 矿机是第一个有足够大挖掘范围能收集整个矿脉的矿机

705
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:28,500
这也是第一个有和锤子一样好时运的

706
00:02:29,133 --> 00:02:31,866
现在使用这个仍然有一些问题

707
00:02:31,866 --> 00:02:34,966
首先你必须确保它不会淋雨

708
00:02:35,933 --> 00:02:39,366
然后另一个问题是管理它的输出

709
00:02:39,366 --> 00:02:41,066
因为它会输出很多东西

710
00:02:41,366 --> 00:02:43,533
你需要一个特别好的箱子

711
00:02:44,066 --> 00:02:47,133
我们以前用压缩箱子

712
00:02:47,366 --> 00:02:48,666
它超级好用

713
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:51,566
那些压缩箱子有大量的存储空间

714
00:02:51,866 --> 00:02:57,533
你可以捡起箱子而不把内容物爆一地

715
00:02:57,700 --> 00:03:02,400
问题是在这个游戏版本中，它的前置是镍铬合金

716
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:06,600
这意味着我们基本上要到这一集结束才能做出它

717
00:03:06,933 --> 00:03:09,533
但理想情况下你想用这个

718
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:13,700
最后，这矿机的最后一个问题是供电

719
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:20,200
所以，使用大型钢流体单元和内燃发电机是一个非常好的方法

720
00:03:20,766 --> 00:03:28,000
但问题是我没有足够的燃油产量来真正做到这一点

721
00:03:28,466 --> 00:03:31,133
由于我们的基地也在为发电挣扎

722
00:03:31,866 --> 00:03:34,333
石油可能是个好主意

723
00:03:34,366 --> 00:03:36,400
我们也可以用它来供电

724
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,733
通常人们会用一些可再生的方法来制造石油，比如用植物

725
00:03:39,900 --> 00:03:41,066
（向上合并）

726
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:44,200
你可以杂交一种产油的植物

727
00:03:44,733 --> 00:03:47,000
你也可以做生物燃油和其他的东西

728
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,900
但我只是想寻找更好的油田

729
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,766
如果我们找到一个

730
00:03:51,766 --> 00:03:52,766
它相当巨大

731
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,766
我们有一个常规油田

732
00:03:56,566 --> 00:04:02,366
基本上那些是 8x8 个区块大的油田

733
00:04:02,366 --> 00:04:04,600
你可以找到一种随机的油

734
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:07,066
例如，这块有石油

735
00:04:07,066 --> 00:04:10,933
里面的每一区块都有不同的值

736
00:04:10,933 --> 00:04:12,200
这个是原油，不用于石油

737
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,533
（向上合并）

738
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:18,566
在我的基地下面有大量的重油储量，这正是我想处理的

739
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
我还发现了一些轻油

740
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:27,100
所有这些不同的油，它改变的是它们产生的副产品的数量

741
00:04:27,666 --> 00:04:29,200
看看蒸馏塔配方

742
